      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Returns true, if the App is using VR focus. This means that the app may handle lifecycle events differently from\nthe regular desktop apps. In this case, FCoreDelegates::ApplicationWillEnterBackgroundDelegate and FCoreDelegates::ApplicationHasEnteredForegroundDelegate\nreflect the state of VR focus (either the app should be rendered in HMD or not)."
